#: qml/Help.qml:25
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Installing Retro Cores"
msgstr "Instaliranje retro jezgara"

#: qml/Help.qml:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KRetro (non-flatpak) requires you to install emulators, called 'libretro "
"cores'.\n"
"You should find these from your distro's package manager, for example, "
"'libretro-mgba' for the GBA emulator core. Once installed, you can select "
"them in the settings."
msgstr ""
"KRetro van Flatpaka zahteva da instalirate emulatore koji se zovu „libretro "
"jezgra“.\n"
"Treba da ih nađete u menadžeru paketa svoje distribucije, na primer "
"„libretro-mgba“ za GBA emulatorsko jezgro. Kada ih instalirate, možete ih "
"izabrati u postavkama."

#: qml/Help.qml:29
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Installing Retro Cores (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Instaliranje retro jezgara (Flatpak)"

#: qml/Help.qml:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The flatpak version of KRetro comes with a curated set of cores already. If "
"you installed KRetro from the official flatpak, you are all set!"
msgstr ""
"Flatpak izdanje KRetro već dolazi sa odabranim skupom jezgara. Ako ste "
"KRetro instalirali iz zvaničnog Flatpak paketa, sve je spremno!"

#: qml/Help.qml:35
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Installing Games"
msgstr "Instaliranje igara"

#: qml/Help.qml:39
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Adding ROMs"
msgstr "Dodavanje ROM fajlova"

#: qml/Help.qml:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KRetro automatically detects supported games (by file extension) from the "
"ROMs directory (which by default is ~/Documents/Games). Simply add your ROMs "
"there and they will appear in the game library!"
msgstr ""
"KRetro automatski otkriva podržane igre (po nastavku fajla) u fascikli ROM "
"fajlova (podrazumevano ~/Documents/Games). Samo dodajte svoje ROM fajlove "
"tamo i pojaviće se u biblioteci igara!"

